    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry Fitzgerald Paul Reynolds are delighted to offer for sale this beautiful detached family home with detached garage on a scenic 0.5-acre site\nSituated in one of Letterkenny's most sought-after residential areas, this beautifully appointed detached family home enjoys a meticulously landscaped site extending to approximately 0.5 acres. Boasting views over Lough Swilly and a sunny rear orientation, the property offers an exceptional blend of comfort, style, and convenience.\nExtending to approximately 197 sq. m., the home features bright, spacious accommodation designed for modern family living. The welcoming entrance hallway leads to a generous living room with a large picture window framing the scenic surroundings. The spacious kitchen flows seamlessly into a formal dining room, while a separate utility room and guest wc provides added practicality.\nThe ground floor also includes two well-proportioned bedrooms, one with an en-suite bathroom, together with a stylish family bathroom. Upstairs, there are two additional bedrooms and a contemporary shower room, providing flexible accommodation for growing families or visiting guests.\nThe property has been exceptionally well maintained and tastefully decorated throughout, allowing the new owners to move in with ease.\nExternally, the grounds are equally impressive, featuring a concrete driveway, beautifully landscaped gardens, and a paved patio area that enjoys sunshine throughout the day. A substantial detached garage, complete with a lofted and partially floored attic space, offers excellent storage and has potential for a variety of additional uses, subject to any necessary consents.\nIdeally located just minutes from Woodlands National School and within easy reach of Letterkenny Town Centre, this outstanding home combines peaceful countryside surroundings with everyday convenience, making it an ideal choice for family living."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.5 x 1.8\nPorcelain tiled flooring. Cloak room. Solid mahogany staircase leading to first floor.\n\nLiving Room - 4.7 x 4.3\nSolid wooden flooring. Cast Iron fireplace with timber surround and matching overmantle mirror. Picture window. Coving to ceiling.\n\nKitchen/Dining Area - 4.3 x 4.1\nTiled flooring. Eye and low level oak units with single drainer sink and tiled splash back. Built in Siemens double oven and five ring gas hob with overhead extractor fan. Integrated Bosh dishwasher and Siemens American style fridge freezer included in sale. Recessed ceiling lights.\n\nUtility Room - 2.2 x 2.0\nBuilt in linen cupboard. Low level units with single drainer sink. Plumbed for washing machine/tumble dryer. Airing cupboard with immersion.\n\nWC - \nTiled flooring. Comprising wc and wash hand basin.\n\nLounge/Formal Dining Room - 4.0 x 3.3\nLocated off Kitchen area. Sliding patio doors leading to front of property. Views of Lough Swilly\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.2 x 4.1\nSolid wooden flooring. One wall complete with floor to ceiling fitted wardrobes and vanity unit.\n\nEnsuite - \nTiled flooring and walls tiled floor to ceiling. Comprising w.c, wash hand basin and electric shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.3 x 3.0\nSolid wooden flooring.\n\nBathroom - 3.1 x 2.0\nTiled flooring and walls tiled floor to ceiling. Comprising w.c, wash hand basin and bath.\n\nLanding - \nCarpet covering on floor. Fully shelved linen cupboard\n\nBedroom 3 - 5.0 x 3.9\nCarpet covering on floor.\n\nWalk in Dressing Room - \nCould easily be converted into ensuite if required.\n\nBedroom 4 - 5.2 x 5.0\nLaminated timber flooring.\n\nWalk in Wardrobe. - \n\n\nShower Room - 2.3 x 2.3\nComprising w.c, wash hand basin and shower.\n\nDetached Garage - 6.2 x 5.0\nElectric up and over door. Stira stairs access to attic space which is partially floored.\n\n"
      },
      {
